---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research Workflow Guidebook
description: 언어를 선택하고, LaTeX부터 GitHub 협업까지 이어지는 연구 워크플로우를 시작하세요.
lang: ko
langSwitch:
  url: /
  label: English
pageClass: page-landing
---
{% set currentUpdates = updates.completedByLang.ko %}
<main>
  <section class="landing-hero">
    <h1 class="wrap hero-h1">효율적인 연구 작업 흐름</h1>
    <p class="wrap lead">LaTeX, VS Code, GitHub로 효율적인 연구 환경을 구축하세요.</p>
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <aside class="hero-panel panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ ui.ko.recentUpdates }}</p>
        <dl class="updates-list">
          {% for item in currentUpdates %}
            {% if loop.index <= 1 %}
              <div>
                <dt class="update-heading">({{ item.date | dateDots }}) {{ item.title }}</dt>
                <dd>
                  {% if item.linkItems %}
                    <ul class="update-link-list">
                      {% for linkItem in item.linkItems %}
                        <li><a href="{{ linkItem.url }}">{{ linkItem.title }}</a></li>
                      {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                  {% elif item.url %}
                    <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>
                  {% else %}
                    {{ item.title }}
                  {% endif %}
                </dd>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>안내 경로</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid route-map-grid">
        {% for section in navigation.sections %}
          <a class="feature-card panel card--{{ section.key }}" href="{{ section.url.ko }}">
            <div class="card-logo-row">
              {% if section.key == "initial-setup" %}
                <img class="card-logo card-logo--latex-full" src="/assets/images/LaTeX_project_logo_bird.svg.png" alt="LaTeX">
                <img class="card-logo card-logo--latex-compact" src="/assets/images/latex-project-logo_288x288.png" alt="LaTeX">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/Visual_Studio_Code_1.35_icon.svg.png" alt="VS Code">
              {% elif section.key == "writing-in-vs-code" %}
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/Visual_Studio_Code_1.35_icon.svg.png" alt="VS Code">
              {% elif section.key == "git-github" %}
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/git-logo.png" alt="Git">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/GitHub-Mark.png" alt="GitHub">
              {% elif section.key == "collaboration" %}
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/git-logo.png" alt="Git">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/GitHub-Mark.png" alt="GitHub">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/overleaf-o-logo-primary.jpg" alt="Overleaf">
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <p class="card-kicker">{{ section.kicker.ko }}</p>
            <h3>{{ section.title.ko }}</h3>
            <p>{{ section.summary.ko }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
